.SH NAME
git-work-issue-comment-edit - Edit an existing comment on an issue


.SH SYNOPSIS
\fBgit-work issue comment edit COMMENT_ID BODY|- [flags]\fP


.SH DESCRIPTION
Replace the body of one comment, given as the argument or on standard input.
COMMENT_ID is the comment's own id, as get and comment new print it.


.SH OPTIONS
\fB-h\fP, \fB--help\fP[=false]
	help for edit


.SH SEE ALSO
\fBgit-work-issue-comment(1)\fP
